{% comment %}
  The brand mark: the hill line from the hero, as a small inline SVG.
  Colored by `color` (currentColor), sized by the width of the class passed in.
  Sources and exported files live in brand/.

  Accepts:
  - class {String}: class for the svg
{% endcomment %}
<svg
  class="brand-line {{ class }}"
  viewBox="-40 80 1680 260"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
  <path
    d="M 0 300 C 160 296 250 214 420 222 S 600 318 760 300 S 930 150 1110 128 S 1290 178 1400 196 S 1540 150 1600 138"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="40"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
  />
</svg>
